Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:06.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.19,0:00:11.41,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,传闻有一位女巫隐居在天窗市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:19.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,在万圣节那天 去女巫的宅邸看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:50.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,女巫和她的伙伴们 会准备好甜蜜的糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,等候你的光临！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:58.28,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}大女巫由由与万圣节派对！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.88,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都知道万圣节是哪种节目吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是能够得到糖果的节日！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是能够穿有趣衣服的节日！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trick or Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这天要说“不给糖就捣蛋”！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是年长班的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:03.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要做万圣节南瓜灯·杰克南瓜的面具！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:03.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1160,970)}{\fs50}Jack o'lantern
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要戴上这个去万圣节狂欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:13.91,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很期待万圣节狂欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举市举办的狂欢节嘛 大家都兴奋起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能去各家各户讨要糖果 小朋友们也乐在其中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家也要准备好糖果了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:27.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怜那有点害怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一点都不怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可要是被魔法变成南瓜头...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？什么？在聊什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说在分发糖果的人家里...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有真正的女巫！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:43.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的女巫？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在山丘上的那家...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:48.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住着一位老奶奶和小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一个小宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.99,0:03:52.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:54.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一只圆滚滚的小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:59.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 那不是我家吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小蝶老师的家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那老师也是女巫的伙伴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太帅了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:08.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,等...等一下！为什么由由阿姨会变成女巫？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她会收集非常漂亮的蓝色石头...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.00,0:04:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跟镜子对话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让小宝宝漂浮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是真正的女巫吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:26.19,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 你也太光明正大了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:28.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:31.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,孙女这么说好像有点怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.37,0:04:33.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶还真的挺像女巫的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像小朋友们都很期待我的表现呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年万圣节必须要加把劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:45.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了！为了让房子看起来像真正的女巫宅邸 我们装饰一下吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:46.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 赞成！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:49.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,过来的小朋友们肯定会喜欢的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:53.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,自然 由由阿姨要打扮成女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大名 大能耐传奇·名誉大女巫·由由
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(790,970)}Hyper NengNai Legend
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:05.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空就是 大可爱肉嘟嘟小小女巫·天空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:06.74,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,打扮成怪物去讨要糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这边世界的节日真有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:12.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:14.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要怎么样参与呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.15,0:05:17.97,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,打扮成服侍女巫的南瓜怪 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,帮忙分发糖果给小朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.28,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这个主意好！太可爱了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:26.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,南瓜怪 我能够胜任吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.05,0:05:28.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,语气要做点变化吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:31.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的口吻 体现不出怪物的气质呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:34.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,比如“给你糖果南瓜”？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:38.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 要干就要干到120分！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:41.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,唔唔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:51.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,糖果... 是不是... 只有小朋友才可以... 拿到的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:55.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我会准备好小晴和大伙的份的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:01.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我太期待万圣节了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可太期待万圣节了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼哼... 啊哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（隔壁那谁在敲墙）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}吓！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口杰口杰口杰口杰...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（敲门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:54.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临女巫馆...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:59.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大女巫在等着呢 请往里走...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临女巫馆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.44,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不... 不给糖...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trick or Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不给糖就捣蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 很有精神！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你意下如何？大女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法道具要是被小捣蛋弄坏了 可就头痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他们糖果吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,来 给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:07:59.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:04.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女巫奶奶 能让我看看魔法道具吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以 跟我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:14.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在万圣节分发糖果也很有趣呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:20.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得万圣节是一个很特别的节日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:23.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,能穿上平时不会穿的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:28.98,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,借由一句"不给糖就捣蛋" 就能跟平时没有交集的人 交流起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:33.05,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,笑容也不断地扩散开来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:37.94,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,万圣节是不是就像是真正的魔法啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:42.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:47.48,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 等会去城里逛逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,唯美着迷也会分发糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(770,970)}Pretty Holic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:50.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:50.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,（响指！）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忒喜欢糖果的捣蛋南瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南瓜头愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Cure Pumpkin！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口杰口杰口杰口杰...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯美着迷咖啡店特制的南瓜头饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也给我一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 要遵守次序...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Trick and Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.75,0:10:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既要捣蛋又要糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是Cure Pumpkin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure的伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.55,0:10:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}万圣节狂欢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pumpkin Cure Cure Pumpkin kin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手！这是给大家准备的糖果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都不知道吗？我是Cure Pumpkin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure可最喜欢捣蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要打扮成Precure捣蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会有大量的Precure粉 转黑吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还能吃到糖果 万圣节最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑 你怎么可能是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure会保护城市！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见到过他们和怪物战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小朋友们说的对！你这个假货！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什... 什么意思？你们这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是正义的伙伴 Precure哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.93,0:11:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}环保袋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蜢 蜢 蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.69,0:11:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻子才不跑 溜了溜了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:43.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？糖果全被抢走了 被Precure？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:45.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:56.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,假冒的Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:58.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,自称是Cure Pumpkin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:01.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,在城里到处捣蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:03.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,市民们没有受伤吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:04.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:08.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 糖果好像都被抢走了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 我们刚准备去的呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:14.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女巫奶奶能用魔法做点什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:35.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:37.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 施了真正的魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,应该只是太期待万圣节 买多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南瓜怪最喜欢人们的笑容了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以肯定能让万圣节重归欢乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:57.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把糖果送给在城里期待着的小朋友们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:02.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,既然假冒的Precure 用恶作剧夺走了人们的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:07.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就要把节日的气氛轰到顶点 取回人们的笑容！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:09.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:12.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,糖果倍增 对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:12.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(860,970)}Treat and Treat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:13.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:17.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不能让假冒的继续妨碍节日了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:19.73,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.16,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:33.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 我们来送糖果和笑容了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,来 给
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还以为拿不到糖果了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 南瓜怪大姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:46.25,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:50.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（快门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.32,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:57.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:13:58.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:11.99,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,糖果！给
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure一伙 搞什么呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少露出一点不甘的表情 来追假冒的Cure Pumpkin啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呸哒！不管你们发多少糖果 取悦那边的家伙们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我Cure Pumpkin都要把这一切搅得天翻地覆！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶... 搞... 搞什么啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！Cure Pumpkin就在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要生气嘛 我有多的糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.93,0:15:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有... 还没完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！暗塌谷能...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完蛋！是他...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:17.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:36.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,指示Cure Pumpkin这个假冒者在街上捣乱 也是你的计谋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:39.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:44.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:50.83,CureSky,,0,0,0,,天空幻镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:50.83,CureSky,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.24,CureSky,,0,0,0,,天籁接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:54.24,CureSky,,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:38.73,CurePri,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:00.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海阔天空变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:03.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:03.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:21.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飞奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:21.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:28.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,畅快跃起！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:28.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,广阔无限的蓝天！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:54.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:54.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}天空愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:01.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辽阔拂远的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:03.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:03.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}棱镜愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:09.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高阔凌云的勇气！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飞翼愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:17.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,壮阔飞扬的神彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:17.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1095,970)}Wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:19.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:19.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}蝴蝶愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:28.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:28.85,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}威爱愈卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:33.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,准备...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:33.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Ready...
