Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.98,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:51.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.25,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好硬...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:57.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:59.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶 凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:03.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:06.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:07.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好敏捷...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.97,0:18:10.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击不要停 尝试抓它的破绽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:17.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:18.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:25.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:27.00,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:28.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没有说...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:30.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:34.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没有说过“不给糖就捣蛋”呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:39.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是非常期待今天这一天的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:41.06,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:47.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 我也想说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:48.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:49.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky说的对！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:52.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
