Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:58.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:04.85,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:10.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,万圣节是特别的魔法时间！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.35,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:18.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶凶凶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.55,0:19:20.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:22.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:26.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要来妨碍大伙的魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:30.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,凶暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在！
