Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然放出那种怪物搞破坏 已经不只是捣蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 那不是我放出来的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别找借口！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不给糖就捣蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Trick or Treat！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 给
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:20.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:22.67,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是宝宝糖果？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对的 等变回去再吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:29.14,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好想吃大伙同款的糖果啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,用不了多久就能吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}天窗市幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶老师家的奶奶 是真正的女巫！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:42.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能用魔法变出很多的糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:46.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还跟Precure聊上了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:47.67,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure也是女巫的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:56.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这下明年万圣节也得加油了 由由阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:21:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿嚏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁在议论我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.41,0:22:03.30,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,呐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Butterfly哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}蝴蝶愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:12.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 一起飞扬跳起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.28,0:23:48.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我和公主结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:49.52,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,要结婚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有你的啊 少年！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:53.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在结婚 会不会还太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:54.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哇哇哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.32,0:23:57.29,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不不！一定要结婚！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:00.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:00.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要好♡ 小空结婚仪式☆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.31,0:01:07.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:13.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:18.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:26.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:31.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:35.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:37.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:41.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:46.14,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:48.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:52.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.07,0:01:56.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:02:00.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:02.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:02.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:07.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:12.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:17.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:22.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:25.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:33.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
